__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"default",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return s}});var o=r(d[0]),t=r(d[1]),n=r(d[2]);function s(){return(0,n.jsx)(o.Legal,{title:"Privacy",updated:"13 November 2026",sections:[{h:"What we collect",p:["Your Asanoha account email, if you sign in. Sign-in is shared across Asanoha apps.","Your questions and Kosmik\u2019s answers, saved to your history when you are signed in, so you can come back to them. You can delete any chat from History.","Your \ud83d\udc4d / \ud83d\udc4e on answers, used to improve the library.","If you add them in Account \u2192 My details: your date, time and place of birth, and photos of your palms. These are sensitive, so we keep them only with your consent, only you can see them, and you can change or delete them any time. To find your place of birth, only the place name you type is sent to OpenStreetMap.","When you ask about your own chart, Kosmik calculates it from your birth details and sends the chart (not your name) to Google Gemini to explain it. When you ask about your palm, your palm photos are sent to Google Gemini to read them. The answers are saved to your history like any other chat.","If you buy Premium: the plan, amount, date and the UPI reference (UTR) of your payment. You pay through Noha Pay, Asanoha\u2019s UPI payment page; we never see your bank or UPI PIN details. Payment records are kept as long as tax law requires.","If you use Kosmik without signing in, we keep a one-way code made from your network address and the date, only to apply the daily guest limit. It changes every day and cannot be turned back into your address."]},{h:"How answers are made",p:["Many answers come straight from Kosmik\u2019s library of Gita verses and written meanings. Others are written by an AI model (Google Gemini), using only that library as its source. For those, your question is sent to Google to write the answer; Google doesn\u2019t use it to train its models.","General questions (not about you personally) and their answers may be kept and shown again to anyone who asks the same thing, without any link to you. Questions that include personal details, such as your birth date or your own chart, are never reused this way."]},{h:"How long we keep it",p:["Chats are deleted automatically 12 months after you last used them, or sooner if you delete them yourself. Birth details and palm photos are kept until you delete them, or your account.","Question counts, including the daily guest code, are deleted after 30 days.","Shared general answers are removed after 6 months if nobody has asked for them, unless we have reviewed them for the library. When a verse or meaning in the library is corrected, answers that relied on the old text stop being shown."]},{h:"What we don\u2019t do",p:["We don\u2019t sell your data, show ads, or use your chats, birth details or palm photos for anything except answering you."]},{h:"Where data lives",p:["Kosmik runs on Cloudflare. Accounts are kept by Supabase. AI answers are written by Google Gemini. Each processes data on our behalf under its own security and privacy terms."]},{h:"Your choices",p:[`Delete chats any time from History. To delete your account and everything linked to it, email ${t.OPERATOR.email} and we will do it within 30 days.`,t.GRIEVANCE,`${t.OPERATOR.name}, ${t.OPERATOR.address}.`]}]})}},768,[820,817,6]);